          "text": "Description: While closing his house shutters at 6:15 PM, a witness observed a large orange and yellow light passing from the SE. During the one-minute observation, no noise was heard. The light then headed north and disappeared from view. Following a gendarmerie investigation, the witness formally identified the photo of PAN as a glowing balloon of a Thai lantern type.",
